government bonds were mixed. Yields on shorter-dated paper were lower, while those on longer-dated debt were unchanged.\par \par \uc2 "There are some flows coming in at the short end as the Singapore dollar has traded near the stronger end, but the market is cautious about an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and we still see sellers (lurking) out there," said a local trader.\par \par \uc2 -By Diana Wang, Dow Jones Newswires; 65 6415 4154; diana.wang@dowjones.com [ 16-07-08 0725GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1163 1859   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020080716e47g000br\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
