b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue to rise, a trader with a foreign bank said.\par \par \uc2 "There's some buying this afternoon, particularly on the short-dated bonds," the trader said.\par \par \uc2 -By Se Young Lee, Dow Jones Newswires; 65 6415 4155; vincent.lee@dowjones.com [ 17-04-08 0750GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1063 1858   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020080417e44h000ck\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
