\par\par \b \uc2 Singapore Dollar Hits Record High; US Dollar Fetches S$1.3821   \b0\par\par\uc2 265 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2008\par 01:43\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 SINGAPORE (Dow Jones)--The Singapore dollar Thursday rose to a record high on continued weakness in the greenback against other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 At 0030 GMT, the U.S. dollar was quoted at S$1.3821. The U.S. dollar's previous record low was S$1.3825, set in May 1995.   \par \par \uc2 Traders and analysts say that the U.S. dollar is likely to remain weak during the session, but that the possibility of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stop the U.S. dollar slide can't be ruled out.   \par \par \uc2 "The MAS may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to cool the market," a trader with a foreign bank said.   \par \par \uc2 "The euro is at record highs and so are the other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . People don't want to keep the dollar," said another trader with a local bank.   \par \par \uc2 "It's difficult to predict a support level now given the (U.S) dollar is at all time low. This trend of weakening is likely to continue."   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  analysts say that investors are selling the U.S. dollar as worries of a U.S. recession mount. These investors are moving toward other assets such as metals and commodities that are moving inversely to the U.S. dollar.   \par \par \uc2 "Their is a flight to value," \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist Emmanuel Ng of OCBC said.   \par \par \uc2 Analysts and traders pegged psychological support for the pair at S$1.3800.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    -By P.R. Venkat, Dow Jones Newswires; +65 64154 152; venkat.pr@dowjones.com (Manish Jaradi contributed to the story) \par     \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 13-03-08 0043GMT ]   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020080313e43d0000h\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
