ight\uc2 , as they feel the growth story still remains in this region," said another trader with a local bank.   \par \par \uc2 In the local bond market, prices remained flat on thin volumes and will look for directions from the U.S. overnight, a trader with a foreign bank said.   \par \par \uc2 "We'll have to see how the (U.S.) Treasurys react to the jobless claims data and the home sales data tonight," said the trader.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    -By P.R. Venkat, Dow Jones Newswires; 65 641541 152, venkat.pr@dowjones.com \par     \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 06-03-08 0731GMT ]   \f28 \par \par \uc2 1163 1859   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020080306e436000ba\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
