\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Singapore \highlight\uc2  Dlr Falls Late Wed On Suspected MAS  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 384 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Februar 2008\par 08:51\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                          Latest   Change \par    USD/SGD               1.4124   +0.0013 \par    Overnight rate        1.31%    +14 bps \par    Two-year bond yield:  1.20%    +1 bp \par    10-year bond yield:   2.31%    Unchanged \par    Two-year swap offer:  1.71%    +6 bps \par    10-year swap offer:   3.19%    +1 bp \par    2-10-yr swap curve:   148 bps  -5 bps \par     \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 SINGAPORE (Dow Jones)--The Singapore dollar fell slightly against the greenback in Asian trade late Wednesday following talk the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Singapore\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  may have \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Tuesday to support the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .   \f28 \par \par \uc2 "Yesterday there was talk that there was official presence near the 1.4100 level," a local trader said.   \par \par \uc2 The MAS manages the Singapore dollar within an undisclosed band, and traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is near the top of that range.   \par \par \uc2 The suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and weak performances by regional bourses kept the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  range-bound despite the U.S. dollar's overnight weakness and inflation pressures from rising oil futures, traders said.   \par \par \uc2 But pressures for the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rise are likely to remain because of the Chinese government's preference to combat domestic inflationary pressures by allowing faster appreciation of the renminbi, a local strategist said.   \par \par \uc2 The renminbi is a part of the trade-weighted basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  on which the MAS's monetary policy band is based.   \par \par \uc2 The local trader said the MAS may have to tighten its monetary policy and allow for faster appreciation of the Singapore dollar should oil futures remain above US$100 a barrel.   \par \par \uc2 But the strategist disagreed, saying high oil prices may only lead to more MAS \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  because the government appears unwilling to shift its monetary policy. Finance Minister Tharman Shanmugaratnam said last week an excessive appreciation of the Singapore dollar could hurt economic growth.   \par \par \uc2 Trade in the local bond market was lackluster on lack of major news, a local bond trader said.   \par \par \uc2 The size of the 20-year bonds scheduled to be reopened Feb. 27 is to be announced after the market's close Wednesday, the trader said.   \par \par \uc2 Traders estimate the issue size to be between S$1 billion and S$1.2 billion.   \par \par \uc2 -By Se Young Lee, Dow Jones Newswires; 65 6415 4155; vincent.lee@dowjones.com [ 20-02-08 0751GMT ]   \par \par \uc2 1163 1859   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020080220e42k000e9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
