$1.2 billion.   \par \par \uc2 -By Patricia Kowsmann, Dow Jones Newswires; 65 6415 4157; patricia.kowsmann@dowjones.com [ 19-02-08 0705GMT ]   \par \par \uc2 1163 1859   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020080219e42j0008w\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
