l government bond market was also quiet, according to a local bond trader. 'There's a lack of interest in general because (market participants) are staying quiet ahead of the reopening of the 20-year bonds next week,' the trader said. The 20-year bonds are scheduled to reopen Feb. 27, with the size of the auction to be announced Wednesday. -By Se Young Lee, Dow Jones Newswires; 65 6415 4155; vincent.lee@dowjones.com -0-    \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJCFWE0020080218e42i003pd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
