er Friday could also move the market next week. Government bond trading was also quiet in low volumes, with no major news to push the market ahead of the payrolls data. A local trader said some of the primary dealers weren't around for today's session, contributing to the inactivity. -By Se Young Lee, Dow Jones Newswires; 65-6415-4155; vincent.lee@dowjones.com -0-    \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJCFWE0020080201e421003xp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
