ng excess liquidity in the market after \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market last week," said a trader with a local bank.   \par \par \uc2 -By P.R. Venkat, Dow Jones Newswires; 65 64154 152; venkat.pr@dowjones.com [ 15-01-08 0732GMT ]   \par \par \uc2 1163 1859   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020080115e41f000ae\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
