market, with one local trader saying that there was very little movement save for some selling in long bonds. 'The market's really quiet, most of the main players are not in,' the trader said. 'Going into the year-end, I don't expect any significant movement' unless there is a huge move in U.S. Treasurys, the trader said. -By Se Young Lee, Dow Jones Newswires; 65 6415 4154; vincent.lee@dowjones.com -0-    \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJCFWE0020071227e3cr002be\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
