 is almost over will keep the greenback's trading levels at around S$1.44 right into early 2008, the trader added.   \par \par \uc2 Local government bond prices rose again, another trader with a local bank said, on foreign investors' strong appetite for short-to-medium range papers, as they bet that the Singapore dollar is expected to appreciate further for some time to come.   \par \par \uc2 By Se Young Lee, Dow Jones Newswires; 65 6415 4154; vincent.lee@dowjones.com [ 13-12-07 0823GMT ]   \par \par \uc2 1163 1859   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020071213e3cd000ck\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
