b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  within a secret trade-weighted band and currently allows a modest, gradual appreciation of the Singapore dollar.   \par \par \uc2 In the government bond market, yields remained flat ahead of the Fed meeting.   \par \par \uc2 "There won't be much of any action till the outcome of the Fed meeting," said the local bank trader, who expects the Fed to cut its key rate by 25 basis points.   \par \par \uc2 "We will have to see how U.S. Treasurys react to the (expected) rate cut and the outlook the Fed paints on the U.S. economy," the trader said.   \par \par \uc2 -By P.R. Venkat, Dow Jones Newswires, 65 64154 152; venkat.pr@dowjones.com [ 29-10-07 0729GMT ]   \par \par \uc2 1163 1859   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020071029e3at000s9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
