icy tool and manages the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  within an undisclosed, trade-weighted band.   \par \par \uc2 On Oct. 10 the MAS shifted policy for the first time since April 2004 and said it would "increase slightly" the maximum rate it allows the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to rise.   \par \par \uc2 Analytical models at several investment banks indicated that the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was near the top of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's undisclosed \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  band Friday morning.   \par \par \uc2 In the local debt market, prices rose sharply as foreign buyers sought Singapore dollar assets.   \par \par \uc2 "It's all inflows," a trader said.   \par \par \uc2 Another trader said the move was exaggerated at the short-end of the maturity spectrum as players with short positions were forced to buy to cover.   \par \par \uc2 -By John Jannarone, Dow Jones Newswires; 65 6415 4153; john.jannarone@dowjones.com [ 19-10-07 0829GMT ]   \par \par \uc2 1163 1859   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020071019e3aj000d5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
